testClientCredentials;config;client;params;tokenResult
⍝ Create OAuth client for client credentials flow (using flat configuration structure)
config←(
    flow: 'clientCredentials'
)
config ⎕NS credentials.custom

client ← ##.SOAC.New config

⍝ Request token using client credentials
params←(
    scope: 'email' 'profile'
    custom: (
        ⍝ Custom params to be passed (Will not be parsed)
    )
)

tokenResult ← client.GetToken params

⍝ Check if successful
:If tokenResult.success
    ⎕ ← 'Access Token: ', tokenResult.access_token
    ⎕ ← 'Expires in: ', tokenResult.expires_in
    :If 0<≢tokenResult.scope
        ⎕ ← 'Granted Scopes: ', tokenResult.scope
    :EndIf
:Else
    ⎕ ← 'Token error: ', tokenResult.error_description
:EndIf
